---
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout title="About — Duane Moore" description="About Duane Moore.">
  <Section title="About" intro="A builder's bio, not a corporate hostage note.">
    <div class="stack">
      <p>
        Duane Moore is an engineer, architect, founder, and systems thinker whose work has ranged from startups and consulting to payments infrastructure, mobile systems, backend platforms, and AI-native tools.
      </p>
      <p>
        He has led engineering organizations, built products across iOS, Android, web, and backend systems, and spent much of his career turning ambitious or messy ideas into software that could survive contact with reality.
      </p>
      <p>
        That work has included product and engineering leadership at Atlas and Channel19, consulting through Zarkov Technologies, payments and platform leadership at Clover, and large-scale systems architecture at Intelligent Software Solutions.
      </p>
      <p>
        He tends to be most interested in products and systems where technical depth actually matters: transaction-heavy platforms, developer tools, operational workflows, AI assistants, and software that has to do more than merely demo well.
      </p>
      <p>
        He writes about software, tools, AI, systems design, and the occasional technological absurdity. These days, his main public outposts are this site, Substack, and <a href="https://x.com/Duane1024">@Duane1024</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stack {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .stack p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.03rem;
  }
</style>
